{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\hist\\013.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Unit:01 The Ancient Civilizations", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[480, 155], [744, 163], [744, 184], [480, 176]]}, {"text": "The Sumerian Civilization", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[98, 189], [512, 206], [511, 236], [97, 219]]}, {"text": "The Sumerain civilization is the", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[145, 241], [580, 254], [579, 284], [144, 270]]}, {"text": "Facts to Know", "conf": 0.839, "box": [[655, 249], [852, 256], [851, 286], [653, 278]]}, {"text": "world's'oldest known ancient civilization", "conf": 0.935, "box": [[97, 272], [579, 288], [578, 317], [96, 301]]}, {"text": "The name 'Sumer' is derived from", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[654, 288], [1086, 292], [1086, 322], [654, 317]]}, {"text": "that flourished 6000 years ago in the", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[97, 305], [579, 321], [578, 351], [96, 335]]}, {"text": "Akkadian, the language of northern", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[654, 320], [1087, 326], [1087, 355], [654, 350]]}, {"text": "Fertile Crescent of Mesopotamia. The", "conf": 0.879, "box": [[96, 338], [580, 353], [579, 383], [95, 368]]}, {"text": "Mesopotamia and means \"land of", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[654, 353], [1091, 354], [1091, 384], [654, 383]]}, {"text": "heartlandof Sumerdeveloped between", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[97, 373], [580, 387], [579, 414], [96, 400]]}, {"text": "civilized kings.'", "conf": 0.827, "box": [[655, 385], [829, 387], [828, 417], [655, 415]]}, {"text": "the Tigris and Euphrates rivers. The", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[96, 404], [584, 416], [583, 449], [95, 437]]}, {"text": "Sumerians are regarded as the founder of civilization. Around 5000 years ago, Sumerian", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[96, 454], [1132, 468], [1131, 501], [95, 487]]}, {"text": "villages grew so large that they became cities. Sumerians were primarily farmers who", "conf": 0.95, "box": [[94, 486], [1134, 499], [1133, 535], [93, 521]]}, {"text": "constructed drains and irrigation channels to enhance agriculture.The geographical area", "conf": 0.92, "box": [[97, 520], [1136, 532], [1135, 567], [96, 555]]}, {"text": "of Sumer and the various empires that ruled Mesopotamia are depicted on the map.", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[98, 551], [1133, 565], [1132, 600], [97, 587]]}, {"text": "Tall Halaf", "conf": 0.809, "box": [[667, 649], [751, 649], [751, 670], [667, 670]]}, {"text": "Hundred Miles", "conf": 0.844, "box": [[202, 683], [358, 687], [357, 711], [201, 707]]}, {"text": "MEDITERRANEAN", "conf": 0.863, "box": [[191, 706], [370, 710], [369, 733], [191, 729]]}, {"text": "Ashur", "conf": 0.747, "box": [[782, 716], [828, 716], [828, 734], [782, 734]]}, {"text": "SEA", "conf": 0.712, "box": [[258, 727], [303, 727], [303, 748], [258, 748]]}, {"text": "Byblos", "conf": 0.855, "box": [[468, 734], [527, 734], [527, 755], [468, 755]]}, {"text": "Samarra", "conf": 0.781, "box": [[873, 732], [942, 736], [941, 757], [872, 753]]}, {"text": "Elam'st", "conf": 0.653, "box": [[1016, 735], [1087, 739], [1086, 759], [1015, 755]]}, {"text": "heartland", "conf": 0.846, "box": [[1018, 757], [1093, 757], [1093, 776], [1018, 776]]}, {"text": "Tyre", "conf": 0.794, "box": [[463, 767], [514, 767], [514, 789], [463, 789]]}, {"text": "Mar", "conf": 0.645, "box": [[714, 768], [746, 768], [746, 779], [714, 779]]}, {"text": "Tigris", "conf": 0.852, "box": [[913, 785], [960, 785], [960, 807], [913, 807]]}, {"text": "Jericho", "conf": 0.856, "box": [[520, 802], [586, 802], [586, 822], [520, 822]]}, {"text": "LOWER", "conf": 0.771, "box": [[156, 813], [240, 815], [239, 836], [156, 834]]}, {"text": "Akkad?", "conf": 0.789, "box": [[821, 808], [888, 808], [888, 828], [821, 828]]}, {"text": "EGYPT", "conf": 0.799, "box": [[161, 833], [236, 833], [236, 854], [161, 854]]}, {"text": "Gizeh", "conf": 0.811, "box": [[236, 846], [287, 848], [286, 869], [235, 867]]}, {"text": "Euphrates", "conf": 0.832, "box": [[802, 846], [893, 848], [893, 872], [802, 870]]}, {"text": "Heliopolis", "conf": 0.859, "box": [[327, 852], [412, 852]